>>SOURCE FORMAT IS FREE
*> A tiny filming demo for COBOL's English-like arithmetic.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ADD-INTEREST-DEMO.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 BALANCE       PIC 9(6)V99 VALUE 1000.00.
01 INTEREST      PIC 9(6)V99 VALUE 50.00.
01 NEW-BALANCE   PIC 9(6)V99.
01 MONEY-DISPLAY PIC $$$,$$9.99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    *> GIVING writes the sum to NEW-BALANCE without changing BALANCE.
    ADD INTEREST TO BALANCE GIVING NEW-BALANCE

    MOVE BALANCE TO MONEY-DISPLAY
    DISPLAY "BALANCE:     " MONEY-DISPLAY
    MOVE INTEREST TO MONEY-DISPLAY
    DISPLAY "INTEREST:    " MONEY-DISPLAY
    MOVE NEW-BALANCE TO MONEY-DISPLAY
    DISPLAY "NEW BALANCE: " MONEY-DISPLAY
    STOP RUN.
